From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Apr 2026 07:51:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add AppSetting model, admin settings UI and optional welcome
 coins on registration

### Motivation

- Introduce a simple key/value settings store to control platform behavior such as granting coins to new users.
- Allow admins to toggle automatic welcome coin grants via the admin UI.
- Enable dark-mode class support in the frontend so the layout can render in dark theme.

### Description

- Add `AppSetting` Eloquent model with `getBool` and `putBool` helpers and a migration `create_app_settings_table` to persist settings.
- Add `PlatformSettingsController` with `edit` and `update` actions and an admin Blade view at `resources/views/admin/settings/edit.blade.php` to manage the `auto_register_coins_enabled` setting.
- Wire up routes `admin.settings.edit` and `admin.settings.update`, and add admin navigation links to access the settings UI.
- Update `RegisteredUserController` to assign `coins` = `1000` for new users when the `auto_register_coins_enabled` setting is true.
- Enable Tailwind dark mode via `darkMode: 'class'` in `tailwind.config.js` and add the `class="dark"` attribute to the guest layout `<html>` element.

### Testing

- Ran the automated test suite with `php artisan test`, and the tests completed successfully.
